{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Engage in intense battles with <strong>2 to 8 players</strong> in arenas full of surprises.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal</strong> is simple: be the last dummy standing! Use all the tools at your disposal to eliminate your opponents and <strong>stay alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Game parameter :</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong> the number of <strong>lives</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose</strong> the number of <strong>HP per life</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game modes :</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic\u00a0</strong>choose your powers at the start of the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random\u00a0</strong>with each death, the power wheel spins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team</strong> choose either the orange or green team at the start of the match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong><i>You can choose 3 powers from the available categories:</i></strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Choose powers like Super Speed or Super Jump to move faster or position yourself strategically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability</strong>: Select powers that modify your traits, such as Invincibility or Knife Throw, to dominate your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon</strong>: In addition to your pistol, choose secondary weapons like a Sniper or explosives to gain a tactical advantage. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=